Gal 2:1 , He shows when he went up again to Jerusalem, and for what purpose;
Gal 2:3 , and that Titus was not circumcised;
Gal 2:11 , and that he resisted Peter, and told him the reason;
Gal 2:14 , why he and others, being Jews, do believe in Christ to be justified by faith, and not by works;
Gal 2:20 , and that they live not in sin, who are so justified.
